OL,3,ASeveral dead in major fire after
OL,4,Aincident at Canadian military base
OL,5,
OL,6,FA defence spokesperson adds that, while
OL,7,Finvestigations are ongoing, they "at
OL,8,Fthis time, there are no indications
OL,9,Fthat it was the result of any terrorist
OL,10,Factivity"
OL,12,FCanadian Forces Base Wainwright, where
OL,13,Fthe fire broke out around 16:00 local
OL,14,Ftime (22:00 GMT) on Saturday, is one of
OL,15,Fthe country's busiest military training
OL,16,Fbases
